message: "If you use this catalog in research or teaching, please cite it as a dataset."
type: dataset
title: "Free Game Dev Assets: a dated, sourced catalog of free game assets and tools with licence metadata"
authors:
  - name: "TMHSDigital"
    website: "https://github.com/TMHSDigital"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TMHSDigital/Free-Game-Dev-Assets"
url: "https://tmhsdigital.github.io/Free-Game-Dev-Assets/"
license: CC0-1.0
version: "v2026.11.01"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
keywords:
  - game-development
  - game-assets
  - licensing
  - open-data
  - catalog
abstract: >-
  A curated catalog of free, commercially usable game assets and tools. Every
  entry records the licence as read at the source on a stated date, the
  commercial stance, the credit requirement and dated evidence quotes. The
  catalog metadata is CC0; the linked assets keep their own licences.
